-## Components and Interfaces
-
-### SimplePackingEngine
-
-The core packing engine that implements the Guillotine Split algorithm.
-
-**Responsibilities:**
-- Initialize free space list with container dimensions
-- Expand cargo with quantity > 1 into individual items
-- Sort cargo by multi-dimensional priority
-- Select optimal space for each cargo item
-- Split occupied space into three sub-spaces
-- Enforce physical constraints (heavy, fragile, rotation)
-- Calculate space utilization and drop order
-
-**Public Interface:**
-
-```javascript
-class SimplePackingEngine {
-  /**
-   * Generate a packing plan for the given cargo list and container
-   * @param {Array<Cargo>} cargoList - List of cargo items to pack
-   * @param {ContainerType} containerType - Container specifications
-   * @returns {Promise<PackingResult>} Packing result with loaded/unloaded cargo
-   */
-  async generatePackingPlan(cargoList, containerType)
-}
-```
-
-**Internal Methods:**
-
-```javascript
-// Cargo preprocessing
-expandToSingleItems(cargoList) // Expand quantity > 1 to individual items
-sortByPriority(cargoList)       // Multi-dimensional sort
-
-// Space management
-selectBestSpace(freeSpaces, rotation) // Find optimal space for cargo
-splitSpace(originalSpace, position, rotation, isFragile) // Create 3 sub-spaces
-
-// Rotation handling
-getAllowedRotations(cargo) // Generate valid rotations based on constraints
-
-// Utilities
-getBatchColor(eta) // Generate consistent color for batch visualization
-```
