-**JavaScript Method**:
-```javascript
-onAIComplianceCheck: function() {
-  console.log('[PackingResult] AI Compliance Check triggered');
-  
-  // Always show confirmation dialog
-  wx.showModal({
-    title: '重新体检确认',
-    content: '是否重新进行AI合规体检？',
