-## Implementation Details
-
-### State Persistence Strategy
-
-**Memory Behavior**:
-- `complianceReport` is stored in Page data object (reactive)
-- Persists during page lifecycle (onLoad → onUnload)
-- Cleared automatically on page unload (session-based)
-- Not persisted to storage (intentional design for fresh data)
-
-**Cleanup Strategy**:
-```javascript
-onUnload: function() {
-  // Clear compliance report cache
-  this.setData({ 
-    complianceReport: null,
-    showComplianceReport: false,
-    isCheckingCompliance: false
-  });
-  
-  // Existing 3D renderer cleanup...
-  if (this.threeRenderer) {
-    this.threeRenderer.dispose();
-    this.threeRenderer = null;
-  }
-}
-```
