-### State Flow Logic
-
-**State Machine Implementation**:
-
-```javascript
-// State: IDLE (No report cached)
-{
-  complianceReport: null,
-  showComplianceReport: false,
-  isCheckingCompliance: false
-}
-
-// Transition: User clicks main button
-onAIComplianceCheck() → Show confirmation dialog
-
-// Transition: User confirms
-triggerComplianceAPI() → State: LOADING
-{
-  complianceReport: null,
-  showComplianceReport: false,
-  isCheckingCompliance: true  // Loading state
-}
-
-// Transition: API success
-handleAPISuccess() → State: SHOWING_REPORT
-{
-  complianceReport: { status, score, issues, advice, timestamp },
-  showComplianceReport: true,
-  isCheckingCompliance: false
-}
-
-// Transition: User closes popup
-onCloseComplianceReport() → State: IDLE (with cached report)
-{
-  complianceReport: { status, score, issues, advice, timestamp },  // Preserved
-  showComplianceReport: false,
-  isCheckingCompliance: false
-}
-
-// Transition: User clicks document icon
-onViewReport() → State: SHOWING_REPORT (instant)
-{
-  complianceReport: { status, score, issues, advice, timestamp },
-  showComplianceReport: true,
-  isCheckingCompliance: false
-}
-
-// Transition: User clicks refresh in popup
-onRefreshReport() → Show confirmation → State: LOADING (popup stays open)
-{
-  complianceReport: { status, score, issues, advice, timestamp },  // Old data
-  showComplianceReport: true,  // Popup remains visible
-  isCheckingCompliance: true
-}
-
-// Transition: Refresh API success
-handleAPISuccess() → State: SHOWING_REPORT (updated)
-{
-  complianceReport: { status, score, issues, advice, timestamp },  // New data
-  showComplianceReport: true,
-  isCheckingCompliance: false
-}
-```
