-### Multi-Device Compatibility
-
-**rpx Unit Usage**:
-- All dimensions use `rpx` (responsive pixel) units
-- Automatically scales across different screen sizes
-- Formula: `1rpx = screen width / 750`
-
-**Touch Target Sizing**:
-- Minimum 44rpx × 44rpx for all interactive elements
-- Document icon: 40rpx × 40rpx with 2rpx padding = 44rpx effective
-- Refresh button: 44rpx × 44rpx explicit size
-
-**Responsive Layout**:
-```css
-.document-icon {
-  width: 40rpx;
-  height: 40rpx;
-  padding: 2rpx;  /* Expands touch target to 44rpx */
-}
-
-.refresh-btn {
-  width: 44rpx;
