-命令:     xelatex main.tex
-触发行:   main.tex:72  → \captionsetup{font={small,bf,heiti}, labelsep=quad, labelfont={bf}}
-报错:     ! Package caption Error: heiti undefined.
-结果:     编译中止，无 main.pdf 生成
-```
