-## Error Handling
-
-### Input Validation Errors
-
-**Error Type**: Invalid Cargo Dimensions
-- **Condition**: Cargo with length, width, or height ≤ 0
-- **Handling**: Skip item, log warning, add to unloadedCargo with reason "Invalid dimensions"
-- **Recovery**: Continue processing remaining items
-
-**Error Type**: Missing Required Fields
-- **Condition**: Cargo missing required fields (dimensions, weight, quantity)
-- **Handling**: Skip item, log error, add to unloadedCargo with reason "Missing required fields"
-- **Recovery**: Continue processing remaining items
-
-**Error Type**: Invalid Container Dimensions
-- **Condition**: Container with innerLength, innerWidth, or innerHeight ≤ 0
-- **Handling**: Throw error immediately, cannot proceed
-- **Recovery**: None - caller must provide valid container
-
-### Computation Errors
-
-**Error Type**: Grid Size Calculation Failure
-- **Condition**: GCD calculation produces invalid result (NaN, undefined, ≤0)
-- **Handling**: Fall back to default grid size of 50mm, log warning
-- **Recovery**: Continue with fallback grid size
-
-**Error Type**: Layer Creation Failure
-- **Condition**: Unable to create any valid layers (all items too tall for container)
-- **Handling**: Return empty packing plan, log error
-- **Recovery**: Return plan with all items in unloadedCargo
-
-**Error Type**: Rotation Selection Failure
-- **Condition**: No valid rotation found for item (all rotations exceed constraints)
-- **Handling**: Skip item, add to unloadedCargo with reason "No valid rotation"
-- **Recovery**: Continue processing remaining items
-
-**Error Type**: Position Finding Timeout
-- **Condition**: Grid search takes too long (>1 second per item)
-- **Handling**: Skip item, add to unloadedCargo with reason "Position search timeout"
-- **Recovery**: Continue processing remaining items
-
-### Performance Errors
-
-**Error Type**: Computation Timeout
-- **Condition**: Total computation time exceeds 10 seconds
-- **Handling**: Stop processing, return partial plan, log warning
-- **Recovery**: Return plan with processed items and remaining items in unloadedCargo
-
-**Error Type**: Memory Overflow
-- **Condition**: Too many items or grid cells causing memory issues
-- **Handling**: Increase grid size to reduce memory usage, log warning
-- **Recovery**: Retry with larger grid size (up to 100mm)
-
-### Optimization Errors
-
-**Error Type**: Utilization Target Not Met
-- **Condition**: Final space utilization < 70%
-- **Handling**: Log warning with actual utilization, return plan anyway
-- **Recovery**: No fallback - return best attempt (removed fallback to old implementation per requirements)
-
-**Error Type**: Loading Rate Below 100%
-- **Condition**: Not all items loaded for Cixi test case
-- **Handling**: Log warning with loading statistics, return plan
-- **Recovery**: No fallback - return best attempt
-
-### Error Logging Format
-
-All errors logged with structured format:
-```javascript
-{
-  timestamp: Date.now(),
-  errorType: String,        // Category of error
-  severity: String,         // "ERROR", "WARNING", "INFO"
-  message: String,          // Human-readable description
-  context: Object,          // Relevant data (item, layer, etc.)
-  recovery: String          // Action taken to recover
-}
-```
