-### Risk Mitigation
-
-**Risk**: Grid size too small causes performance issues
-- **Mitigation**: Cap grid size at 10mm minimum, monitor grid search time
-- **Fallback**: Increase grid size if search takes >1 second per item
-
-**Risk**: Dynamic layers create too many small layers
-- **Mitigation**: Enforce minimum layer height (200mm)
-- **Fallback**: Merge small adjacent layers
-
-**Risk**: Rotation optimization causes placement failures
-- **Mitigation**: Keep height-based rotation as fallback option
-- **Fallback**: Try both strategies, use whichever places more items
-
-**Risk**: Layer assignment optimization reduces loading rate
-- **Mitigation**: Prioritize loading rate over utilization
-- **Fallback**: Disable layer assignment optimization if loading rate <100%
-
-**Risk**: Computation time exceeds 10 seconds
-- **Mitigation**: Add timeout checks, return partial plan
-- **Fallback**: Increase grid size to reduce search space
-
