-# Requirements Document
-
-## Introduction
-
-本需求文档定义了装箱方案界面的预览显示功能增强。当前装箱方案界面在生成方案前显示为空白状态，仅有"生成装箱方案"按钮。本功能将在生成前展示已选择的集装箱信息和已录入的货物列表，为用户提供更好的上下文信息和确认机会。
-
-## Glossary
-
-- **Packing_Plan_Screen**: 装箱方案界面，用户生成和查看装箱方案的页面
-- **Container_Card**: 集装箱卡片，显示已选择的集装箱类型和规格信息
-- **Cargo_List**: 货物列表，显示用户已录入的所有货物信息
-- **Pre_Generation_State**: 生成前状态，指用户尚未点击"生成装箱方案"按钮的界面状态
-- **Store**: 全局状态管理器，存储应用的共享数据
-- **WeChat_MiniProgram**: 微信小程序，本应用的运行平台
-
-## Requirements
-
-### Requirement 1: Display Selected Container Information
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望在生成装箱方案前看到已选择的集装箱信息，以便确认选择是否正确。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. WHEN THE Packing_Plan_Screen loads, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL retrieve the selected container from Store
-2. WHEN a selected container exists, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the Container_Card with container specifications
-3. THE Container_Card SHALL display the container type identifier (e.g., "20GP", "40HQ")
-4. THE Container_Card SHALL display the internal dimensions (length, width, height)
-5. THE Container_Card SHALL display the maximum weight capacity
-6. WHEN no container is selected, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display a prompt message directing users to select a container
-
-### Requirement 2: Display Entered Cargo List
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望在生成装箱方案前看到已录入的货物列表，以便确认货物信息是否完整。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. WHEN THE Packing_Plan_Screen loads, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL retrieve the cargo list from Store
-2. WHEN cargo items exist, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the Cargo_List with all entered cargo items
-3. FOR EACH cargo item, THE Cargo_List SHALL display the cargo name
-4. FOR EACH cargo item, THE Cargo_List SHALL display the dimensions (length × width × height)
-5. FOR EACH cargo item, THE Cargo_List SHALL display the quantity
-6. FOR EACH cargo item, THE Cargo_List SHALL display the weight
-7. THE Cargo_List SHALL display the total number of cargo items
-8. WHEN no cargo items exist, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display a prompt message directing users to add cargo
-
-### Requirement 3: Display Summary Statistics
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望看到货物的汇总统计信息，以便快速了解装箱任务的规模。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. WHEN cargo items exist, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL calculate the total cargo count
-2. WHEN cargo items exist, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL calculate the total weight of all cargo
-3. WHEN cargo items exist, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL calculate the total volume of all cargo
-4. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the total cargo count in the summary section
-5. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the total weight with unit (kg or tons) in the summary section
-6. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the total volume with unit (cubic meters) in the summary section
-
-### Requirement 4: Maintain Generate Button Accessibility
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望"生成装箱方案"按钮始终可见且易于访问，以便在确认信息后快速生成方案。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the "生成装箱方案" button in the Pre_Generation_State
-2. WHEN both container and cargo exist, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL enable the "生成装箱方案" button
-3. WHEN container is missing OR cargo list is empty, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL disable the "生成装箱方案" button
-4. WHEN the "生成装箱方案" button is disabled, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display a tooltip explaining the missing requirements
-5. THE "生成装箱方案" button SHALL remain visible during scrolling of the preview content
-
-### Requirement 5: Support Navigation to Edit Screens
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望能够从预览界面快速返回修改集装箱或货物信息，以便纠正错误或调整配置。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. THE Container_Card SHALL include a "修改" (Edit) button
-2. WHEN the Container_Card edit button is tapped, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL navigate to the container selection screen
-3. THE Cargo_List SHALL include a "添加货物" (Add Cargo) button
-4. WHEN the "添加货物" button is tapped, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL navigate to the cargo input screen
-5. WHEN navigating back from edit screens, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL refresh the displayed information from Store
-
-### Requirement 6: Preserve Existing Post-Generation Functionality
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望生成装箱方案后的所有现有功能保持不变，以便继续使用3D可视化和分析工具。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. WHEN the "生成装箱方案" button is tapped, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL hide the preview content
-2. WHEN the packing plan generation completes, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display the 3D visualization canvas
-3. WHEN the packing plan generation completes, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display all existing post-generation UI elements
-4. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL maintain all existing 3D interaction features (camera controls, filtering, cargo inspection)
-5. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL maintain all existing safety metrics and warning displays
-
-### Requirement 7: Handle Loading and Error States
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望在数据加载或出现错误时看到清晰的提示信息，以便了解系统状态。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. WHEN THE Packing_Plan_Screen is loading data from Store, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display a loading indicator
-2. WHEN Store data retrieval fails, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display an error message
-3. WHEN Store data retrieval fails, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL provide a retry button
-4. WHEN the retry button is tapped, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL attempt to reload data from Store
-5. IF Store data is corrupted, THEN THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL display a message directing users to restart the data entry process
-
-### Requirement 8: Responsive Layout for Different Screen Sizes
-
-**User Story:** 作为用户，我希望预览界面在不同尺寸的手机屏幕上都能正常显示，以便在各种设备上使用。
-
-#### Acceptance Criteria
-
-1. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL use responsive layout units (rpx) for all preview components
-2. WHEN the screen width is less than 375px, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL adjust font sizes for readability
-3. WHEN the screen width is less than 375px, THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL stack Container_Card and summary sections vertically
-4. THE Cargo_List SHALL support vertical scrolling when cargo items exceed the visible area
-5. THE Packing_Plan_Screen SHALL maintain a minimum touch target size of 44px for all interactive elements
-
