-# Design Document: Port Dynamics Dashboard
-
-## Overview
-
-The Port Dynamics Dashboard is a real-time information display component integrated into the WeChat miniprogram homepage. It provides users with timely port updates, route changes, and operational notifications through an auto-rotating vertical swiper interface.
-
-### Design Goals
-
-1. **Seamless Integration**: Position the dashboard prominently on the homepage without disrupting existing layout
-2. **Resilient Data Delivery**: Ensure users always see port information through fallback mechanisms
-3. **Visual Clarity**: Use color-coded labels and clear typography to communicate update urgency
-4. **Performance**: Load asynchronously without blocking homepage rendering
-
-### Key Design Decisions
-
-- **Custom Component Architecture**: Use WeChat's component system (`components/port-dashboard/`) for modularity and reusability
-- **Vertical Swiper Pattern**: Leverage WeChat's native `<swiper>` component for smooth auto-rotation
-- **Fallback-First Strategy**: Implement client-side fallback data to guarantee content availability
-- **Timeout-Based Resilience**: 5-second API timeout with automatic fallback to prevent loading delays
-
-## Architecture
-
-### System Context
-
-```
-┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
-│                    WeChat Miniprogram                        │
-│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
-│  │              Homepage (pages/index/index)             │  │
-│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │  │
-│  │  │          四宫格 Core Functions                   │  │  │
-│  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │  │
-│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │  │
-│  │  │    Port Dynamics Dashboard Component            │  │  │
-│  │  │  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────┐  │  │  │
-│  │  │  │  Vertical Swiper (3s auto-rotate)        │  │  │  │
-│  │  │  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │  │  │
-│  │  │  │  │ Update Card (color-coded)           │ │  │  │  │
-│  │  │  │  └─────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │  │  │
-│  │  │  └───────────────────────────────────────────┘  │  │  │
-│  │  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │  │
-│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
-│                          │                                   │
-│                          │ wx.request()                      │
-│                          ▼                                   │
-│              ┌─────────────────────────┐                     │
-│              │  Fallback Data (local)  │                     │
-│              └─────────────────────────┘                     │
-└──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────┘
-                           │ HTTP GET (5s timeout)
-                           ▼
-┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
-│                    Node.js Backend                           │
-│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
-│  │         Express Router: /api/port/updates             │  │
-│  │                        │                               │  │
-│  │                        ▼                               │  │
-│  │              PortUpdateService                         │  │
-│  │         (Mock data / Future API integration)           │  │
-│  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
-└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
-```
-
-### Component Hierarchy
-
-```
-pages/index/index
-├── [Existing Components]
-│   └── 四宫格 Grid
-└── components/port-dashboard/port-dashboard
-    ├── Header Section
-    │   ├── Icon (📢)
-    │   └── Title ("宁波港实时航线与入港动态")
-    └── Swiper Container
-        └── swiper-item (for each update)
-            ├── Type Label (color-coded)
-            ├── Update Title
-            ├── Update Content
-            └── Timestamp
