-## Data Models
-
-### PortUpdate Object
-
-```typescript
-interface PortUpdate {
-  type: 'urgent' | 'warning' | 'info' | 'normal';
-  title: string;           // Max 50 characters
-  content: string;         // Max 200 characters
-  timestamp: string;       // Format: "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm"
-}
-```
-
-**Field Specifications**:
-
-- **type**: Update urgency classification
-  - `urgent`: Critical port operations (red label)
-  - `warning`: Important notices (orange label)
-  - `info`: General information (blue label)
-  - `normal`: Routine updates (green label)
-
-- **title**: Brief headline of the update
-  - Required, non-empty
-  - Recommended length: 10-30 characters
-  - Displayed in bold font
-
-- **content**: Detailed description
-  - Required, non-empty
-  - Recommended length: 30-150 characters
-  - Displayed in regular font
-
-- **timestamp**: When the update was issued
-  - Required, non-empty
-  - Format: "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm"
-  - Displayed in small gray font
