-## Error Handling
-
-### Input Validation Errors
-
-```javascript
-class InputValidationError extends Error {
-  constructor(field, reason) {
-    super(`Invalid input: ${field} - ${reason}`);
-    this.name = 'InputValidationError';
-    this.field = field;
-    this.reason = reason;
-  }
-}
-
-// Example usage in Input Parser
-validateCargo(cargoData) {
-  if (!cargoData.length || cargoData.length <= 0) {
-    throw new InputValidationError('length', 'must be a positive number');
-  }
-  
-  if (!['carton', 'wooden', 'pallet'].includes(cargoData.packagingType)) {
-    throw new InputValidationError('packagingType', 'must be one of: carton, wooden, pallet');
-  }
-  
-  if (!cargoData.sku || cargoData.sku.trim() === '') {
-    throw new InputValidationError('sku', 'must be a non-empty string');
-  }
-  
-  // ... more validations
-}
-```
-
-### Packaging Strength Violation Warnings
-
-当包装强度验证失败时,引擎不会抛出错误,而是拒绝该位置并尝试其他位置。如果所有位置都不合规,货物将被标记为unloaded:
-
-```javascript
-// In placeCargoGlobally method
-if (!this.validatePackagingStrength(x, y, z, l, w, h, cargo)) {
-  if (this.config.debugMode) {
-    console.log(`⚠️  Packaging strength violation at (${x}, ${y}, ${z}) for cargo ${cargo.cargoId}`);
-  }
-  continue; // Try next position
-}
-```
-
-### LIFO Violation Warnings
-
-类似地,LIFO违规也会导致位置被拒绝:
-
-```javascript
-if (!this.checkSoftIsolationLIFO(x, y, z, l, w, h, cargo)) {
-  if (this.config.debugMode) {
-    console.log(`⚠️  LIFO violation at (${x}, ${y}, ${z}) for cargo ${cargo.cargoId}`);
-  }
-  continue; // Try next position
-}
-```
-
-### CoG Offset Warnings
-
-如果最终结果的重心偏移超过阈值,在结果中添加警告:
-
-```javascript
-buildResult(expandedCargo) {
-  // ... existing code ...
-  
-  const warnings = [];
-  if (cogOffset.lateral > this.config.maxCoGOffset) {
-    warnings.push({
-      type: 'CoG_OFFSET_EXCEEDED',
-      message: `Lateral CoG offset ${cogOffset.lateral}% exceeds limit ${this.config.maxCoGOffset}%`,
-      severity: 'WARNING'
-    });
-  }
-  
-  return {
-    ...result,
-    warnings
-  };
-}
-```
-
-### Graceful Degradation
-
-当某些特性无法满足时,引擎应优雅降级:
-
-1. **SKU聚合度不足**: 如果无法达到70%聚合度,仍然完成装箱,但在metrics中标记实际聚合度
-2. **利用率不足**: 如果无法达到80%利用率,仍然返回结果,但在warnings中标记
-3. **分区配平失败**: 如果无法完美配平,仍然完成装箱,但在warnings中标记偏移量
-
