-## Error Handling
-
-### Missing Data Fields
-
-**Scenario**: Backend API returns cargo items with missing `name` or `sku` fields
-
-**Handling Strategy**:
-```javascript
-generateUniqueSkuList(loadedCargo) {
-  const skuSet = new Set();
-  
-  loadedCargo.forEach((item, index) => {
-    // Fallback chain: name → sku → default
-    const skuName = item.name || item.sku || `Unknown-${index}`;
-    
-    if (!item.name && !item.sku) {
-      console.warn(`[PackingResult] Cargo item ${index} missing name and sku fields`);
-    }
-    
-    skuSet.add(skuName);
-  });
-  
-  return Array.from(skuSet).sort();
-}
-```
-
-### Invalid Touch Coordinates
-
-**Scenario**: Touch event provides coordinates outside canvas bounds
-
-**Handling Strategy**:
-```javascript
-detectCargoClick(touchX, touchY, canvasWidth, canvasHeight) {
-  // Validate coordinates
-  if (touchX < 0 || touchX > canvasWidth || touchY < 0 || touchY > canvasHeight) {
-    console.warn('[ThreeRenderer] Touch coordinates outside canvas bounds:', { touchX, touchY });
-    return null;
-  }
-  
-  // Proceed with raycasting
-  const ndc = this.touchToNDC(touchX, touchY, canvasWidth, canvasHeight);
-  // ...
-}
-```
-
-### Uninitialized ThreeRenderer
-
-**Scenario**: User interacts with UI before ThreeRenderer initialization completes
-
-**Handling Strategy**:
-```javascript
-onSkuFilterChange(e) {
-  const selectedSkus = e.detail.value;
-  this.setData({ selectedSkus });
-  
-  if (!this.threeRenderer || !this.threeRenderer.isInitialized) {
-    console.warn('[PackingResult] ThreeRenderer not initialized, deferring visibility update');
-    // Store selection for later application
-    this.pendingSkuSelection = selectedSkus;
-    return;
-  }
-  
-  this.threeRenderer.updateSkuVisibility(selectedSkus);
-}
-```
-
-### Empty Cargo Array
-
-**Scenario**: Backend returns empty loadedCargo array
-
-**Handling Strategy**:
-```javascript
-generatePackingPlan() {
-  // ... API call
-  .then((response) => {
-    const data = response.data || response;
-    
-    if (!data.loadedCargo || data.loadedCargo.length === 0) {
-      console.warn('[PackingResult] No loaded cargo in response');
-      wx.showToast({ title: '无装载货物', icon: 'none' });
-      this.setData({ 
-        uniqueSkuList: [],
-        selectedSkus: []
-      });
-      return;
-    }
-    
-    // Proceed with normal flow
-    // ...
-  });
-}
-```
-
-### Material Cache Overflow
-
-**Scenario**: Too many unique colors cause material cache to grow excessively
-
-**Handling Strategy**:
-```javascript
-getCachedMaterial(color) {
-  // Limit cache size to prevent memory issues
-  const MAX_CACHE_SIZE = 100;
-  
-  if (!this.materialCache.has(color)) {
-    if (this.materialCache.size >= MAX_CACHE_SIZE) {
-      console.warn('[ThreeRenderer] Material cache limit reached, clearing oldest entries');
-      // Clear half the cache (FIFO)
-      const entries = Array.from(this.materialCache.entries());
-      entries.slice(0, MAX_CACHE_SIZE / 2).forEach(([key, material]) => {
-        material.dispose();
-        this.materialCache.delete(key);
-      });
-    }
-    
-    const material = new this.THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({
-      color: new this.THREE.Color(color),
-      roughness: 0.5,
-      metalness: 0.1,
-      transparent: true,
-      opacity: 1.0,
-      depthWrite: true
-    });
-    this.materialCache.set(color, material);
-  }
-  
-  return this.materialCache.get(color);
-}
-```
